@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+@ Daily Red: the voicegroup for Mt. Silver's summit wind
+@ (mus_dailyred_mt_silver_wind): one voice, the looping wind sample at its own
+@ pitch (C3), full sustain, so the song's single held note plays it forever.
+voice_group dailyred_mt_silver_wind
+	voice_directsound 60, 0, DirectSoundWaveData_dailyred_mt_silver_wind, 255, 0, 255, 0
