+// Daily Red: the EV/IV screen, from the start menu's Stats icon. A port of
+// Gender-based-EV-IV-Display (Acimut, Shiny Miner, Tio Terry; a FireRed C
+// injection) to the expansion, in Daily Red's red (scripts/graphics/make-ui.py).
+// For each of the team: base stats, EVs and IVs per stat (the nature's raised
+// stat in red with an up arrow, its lowered one in blue), the totals, the
+// Hidden Power type, level, nature and happiness, with the Pokemon jumping in
+// beside its type icons and a ball per team member. Left and right (or up and
+// down by rows of balls) change Pokemon, A plays its cry, B goes back.
+#include "global.h"
+#include "battle_main.h"
+#include "bg.h"
+#include "dailyred.h"
