+// Daily Red: the Pokemon summary, in the style of CompuMaxx's BW summary screen
+// for FireRed (Shiny-Miner/New-BW-summary-screen, ported by Zake), redrawn here
+// for the expansion's data and recoloured red (scripts/graphics/make-ui.py). Its
+// pages, layout, graphics and controls are the original's; what Daily Red
+// doesn't need (eggs, boxes, trades, swapping moves) isn't here, and the move
+// details show the move's category by name.
+//
+// Pages: info (dex number, species, types, trainer, item, a memo), skills
+// (stats with the nature's raised one in red and lowered one in blue, HP and
+// EXP bars, ability), moves (type, name and PP) and, from moves with A, a
+// move's details. Left/right change page, up/down the Pokemon, B goes back.
+// Over a red grid that scrolls, with the Pokemon on the right.
